<dialog id="search-dialog" aria-labelledby="search-title"><div class="dialog-header"><h2 id="search-title">搜索</h2><button class="close-button" data-close="search-dialog" aria-label="关闭搜索">×</button></div><input id="search-input" type="search" placeholder="文章 / 栏目" aria-label="搜索关键词" autocomplete="off"><div id="search-results" aria-live="polite" aria-busy="false"></div></dialog>
<dialog id="credits-dialog" aria-labelledby="credits-title"><div class="dialog-header"><h2 id="credits-title">图像来源</h2><button class="close-button" data-close="credits-dialog" aria-label="关闭来源说明">×</button></div><div class="source-links"><a href="https://bocchi.rocks/tv/story/?id=05" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">TV 第 5 话 · 官方剧照 <span>↗</span></a><a href="https://bocchi.rocks/tv/story/?id=08" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">TV 第 8 话 · 官方剧照 <span>↗</span></a><a href="https://bocchi.rocks/omnibus/character/nijika.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">剧场总集篇 · 官方角色立绘 <span>↗</span></a></div><p class="credits-note">夜场与日光主视觉、水彩手账、套色演出海报、像素小舞台及后台肖像：AI 创作的主题同人插画，非官方剧照。每日小签为本站原创短句。</p><p class="credits-note">© はまじあき／芳文社・アニプレックス</p><p class="credits-note"><a href="https://hexo.io/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Hexo</a> / <a href="https://github.com/EvanNotFound/hexo-theme-redefine" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Redefine</a> · Nijika customization</p></dialog>
<dialog id="rhythm-dialog" aria-labelledby="rhythm-title"><div class="dialog-header"><h2 id="rhythm-title">节拍</h2><button class="close-button" data-close="rhythm-dialog" aria-label="关闭节奏台">×</button></div><div class="beat-display" aria-label="四拍节奏"><i class="beat-light"></i><i class="beat-light"></i><i class="beat-light"></i><i class="beat-light"></i></div><div class="drum-pads"><button data-drum="kick" aria-label="底鼓"><strong>咚</strong><small>KICK</small></button><button data-drum="snare" aria-label="军鼓"><strong>哒</strong><small>SNARE</small></button><button data-drum="hat" aria-label="踩镲"><strong>次</strong><small>HI-HAT</small></button></div><div class="rhythm-controls"><label for="tempo"><output id="tempo-output">92</output> BPM</label><input id="tempo" type="range" min="60" max="140" value="92"><button id="rhythm-play" aria-pressed="false">播放</button></div><div class="sequencer" aria-label="十六步鼓机"><div class="sequencer-heading"><span>16 STEP / YOUR OWN GROOVE</span><button data-sequence-reset>恢复节奏</button></div><% for(const [sound,label] of [['kick','底鼓'],['snare','军鼓'],['hat','踩镲']]) { %><div class="sequence-row"><span><%= label %></span><div><% for(let step=0;step<16;step++) { %><button data-step="<%= step %>" data-track="<%= sound %>" aria-label="<%= label %>第 <%= step+1 %> 步" aria-pressed="false"></button><% } %></div></div><% } %></div><div class="rhythm-bottom"><button data-tap-tempo>点按测速 / TAP</button><a href="<%= url_for('studio/') %>">六轨编排 · 节奏实验室 ↗</a></div></dialog>
<dialog id="image-dialog" class="image-dialog" aria-label="查看图片"><button class="close-button" data-close="image-dialog" aria-label="关闭图片">×</button><figure><img alt=""><figcaption></figcaption></figure></dialog>

<dialog id="help-dialog" aria-labelledby="help-title"><div class="dialog-header"><h2 id="help-title">后台操作小抄</h2><button class="close-button" data-close="help-dialog" aria-label="关闭操作小抄">×</button></div><div class="help-shortcuts"><p><kbd>Ctrl / ⌘</kbd> + <kbd>K</kbd><span>搜索文章</span></p><p><kbd>?</kbd><span>打开这张小抄</span></p><p><kbd>Esc</kbd><span>关闭弹窗 / 退出专注</span></p></div><div class="help-links"><a href="<%= url_for('notes/') %>?view=graph">全文检索 · 主题星图 ↗</a><a href="<%= url_for('studio/') %>">六轨音序 · 混音 · WAV 录制 ↗</a><button class="queue-open">阅读队列 ↗</button><button class="lighting-open">舞台调光台 ↗</button><a href="<%= url_for('lounge/') %>">阅读歌单 · 访客票根 · 专注计时 ↗</a><a href="<%= url_for('guestbook/') %>">站内昵称留言 ↗</a><a href="<%= url_for('atom.xml') %>">RSS 订阅 ↗</a></div><p class="credits-note">阅读进度、收藏和票根仅保存在本机。清理浏览器数据后会重置。留言审核后公开；来访按浏览器去重，同一页面每半小时计一次。</p></dialog>
